  "title": "This Week In React #292: Octane, TanStack, StableRef, Next.js, Canvas UI, Reassure, CSS-in-JS | Workers, SafeAreaView, backgroundImage, WebGPU, VisionCamera, React Navigation, Canvas Kit, Nitro | TC39, Web Vitals, Playwright, Webpack, npm",
